<title>DENMARK: Sweden's Telia wins a Danish DCS-1800 licence.</title>
<headline>Sweden's Telia wins a Danish DCS-1800 licence.</headline>
<dateline>COPENHAGEN 1997-03-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Sweden's Telia was one of five bidders awarded Danish DCS-1800 mobile telephone licences on Wednesday, the Danish National Telecoms agency said.</p>
</text>
